# ---- Processed data -------------------------------------------------------
# Tracked: data/processed/vertices.csv, roads.csv (loaded by the app) and
# region_map.png. Not tracked:
#   road_geometry.csv  - 140 MB, over GitHub's 100 MB file limit, and not
#                        read by the C code (regenerate with
#                        scripts/process_roads.py)
#   *.geojson          - osmium export of the raw extract, unused
#   backup-*/          - local backups of older data
data/processed/road_geometry.csv
data/processed/*.geojson
data/processed/backup-*/

